#\#CIF_2.0
# Hand-written magnetic CIF for MOTIF's examples and tests. Not taken from any database.
#
# The textbook two-sublattice antiferromagnet MnF2 (rutile structure): the Mn moment at the
# cell corner points along +c, the Mn moment at the body centre along -c
# (R. A. Erickson, Phys. Rev. 90, 779 (1953)). Magnetic space group P4_2'/mnm' (BNS 136.499),
# magnetic cell = chemical cell. Cell lengths, the F coordinate and the moment size are
# rounded, illustrative values.
data_MnF2_antiferromagnet
_chemical_name_common            'MnF2, antiferromagnetic'
_chemical_formula_sum            'F2 Mn'
_cell_length_a                   4.874
_cell_length_b                   4.874
_cell_length_c                   3.310
_cell_angle_alpha                90
_cell_angle_beta                 90
_cell_angle_gamma                90
_space_group_magn.name_BNS       "P4_2'/mnm'"
_space_group_magn.number_BNS     136.499
loop_
_space_group_symop_magn_operation.id
_space_group_symop_magn_operation.xyz
1  x,y,z,+1
2  -x,-y,z,+1
3  -y+1/2,x+1/2,z+1/2,-1
4  y+1/2,-x+1/2,z+1/2,-1
5  -x+1/2,y+1/2,-z+1/2,+1
6  x+1/2,-y+1/2,-z+1/2,+1
7  y,x,-z,-1
8  -y,-x,-z,-1
9  -x,-y,-z,+1
10 x,y,-z,+1
11 y+1/2,-x+1/2,-z+1/2,-1
12 -y+1/2,x+1/2,-z+1/2,-1
13 x+1/2,-y+1/2,z+1/2,+1
14 -x+1/2,y+1/2,z+1/2,+1
15 -y,-x,z,-1
16 y,x,z,-1
loop_
_space_group_symop_magn_centering.id
_space_group_symop_magn_centering.xyz
1 x,y,z,+1
loop_
_atom_site_label
_atom_site_type_symbol
_atom_site_fract_x
_atom_site_fract_y
_atom_site_fract_z
_atom_site_occupancy
Mn1 Mn 0 0 0 1
F1 F 0.305 0.305 0 1
loop_
_atom_site_moment.label
_atom_site_moment.crystalaxis_x
_atom_site_moment.crystalaxis_y
_atom_site_moment.crystalaxis_z
Mn1 0 0 5.0
